-9f21-bac2cd6df90e"))(text "RM520N-GL: send AT+CFUN=0 and wait for OK BEFORE RUN off; allow >=900 ms to finish.\nEM9190: RUN off after boot; wait until isolated PLA_S2# status goes low (up to 8 s) before POWER off.\nAbrupt unplug or authorization loss cannot guarantee graceful firmware shutdown. See sequencing-review.md." (at 30.48 368.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d5ca114e-84bd-58eb-8bf3-1a23d6096217")))